{
  "Script": "Story/AC42/Day01/Novel/AC42_01_08_01",
  "Entries": [
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00315_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(When setting 31-X's current coordination rate as <i>r</i>, increasing the rate of success requires...)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00316_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Hey, Vri~. Eating solo todayyy?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00317_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yotsuha.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00318_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Mm? Is it just me, or are you even more quiet than usuaaal?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00319_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "...That was not my intent.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00322_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "And I do not eat solo. It simply turned out that way today.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00323_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Wanna eat at our table, then?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00324_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I'm hungwy~.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00325_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Hello.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00326_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh, Vritika. Thank you for always keeping Yotsuha company. Did you come to have dinner with us?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00327_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Assuming I am not intruding by doing so.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00328_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh, not at all! Food tastes better when we eat together.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00329_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Vritika, what's that?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00330_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Canned soup kari. I enjoy my kari this way on days when I have no time to cook.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00331_NiOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "You're every bit the curry connoisseur the rumors describe.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00333_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Niina, do not call it curry. You're supposed to call it kari.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00334_NiOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh, pardon! Did I offend you?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00335_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Don't worry about it~. She's been kinda irritated this whole timeee.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800023_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "So? What's bothering you?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800024_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It is not something I should bother you about...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800025_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Mmgh...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800026_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "What do I do with yooou... Isuzu, do your thing~.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00337_IrOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It's not often we all have dinner together. Go on, let me sneak a peek at whatever's on your chest...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200018_NiOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Stop. Isuzu, don't use your massages to force her to talk when she doesn't want to.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00339_IrOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh, come on, Niina, you're still holding a grudge about that one time with Asami?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200019_NiOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "No, I, uh...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00342_MiOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Eh, what are you talking about?! What happened?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200016_MuOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh, yeah, Niina's been getting close to Instructor Asami. I've been seeing them hanging out together recently!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00343_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh, no, don't tell me she's leading our Niina by the nose...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907400032_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oooh, I guess Niina's a real precocious girl in her own right~.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200020_NiOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "D-Don't take her at her word! It's nothing that serious, really!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200021_NiOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Don't put such a weird spin on things, Isuzu...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00344_IrOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "'Kaaay.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200022_NiOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I'm sorry, Vritika, we got in the way of your story.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00345_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I do not mind.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00353_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(Is this what they are always like? What a strange bunch...)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00354_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(But they seem so lively and happy together... 31-X are lively too, but it feels different...)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00355_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(Is it because they are family?)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00356_NiOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "But maybe you'll feel easier talking to us than someone else. Would you like to confide in us?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00358_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yes... I will take you up on your kind offer, then.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00359_IrOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I see... Your team's coordination isn't going according to your calculations. If anything, it's getting worse...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00360_MuOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "But everyone agrees things can't stay as they are, right?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00361_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Haan. That is what I thought...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00362_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I wonder why it's not working out. Do you have any idea what might be the reason?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00363_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Well...I suspect it may have been today's events.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00364_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "We had a fight over who should make breakfast in the morning.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00365_MiOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "A fight over breakfast?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00366_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "We have always been like this. Bickering over the smallest things...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00367_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Carole and Maria in particular tend to let the blood rush to their heads, and become very crass, which spoils the mood...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00368_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yingxia is intellectual, but that makes her very prideful...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00369_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Irene often gets carried away and says one word too many...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00370_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "And Charl may appear reserved, but she can be quite stubborn and prone to going off on her own...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00371_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "They are all obstinate, and very selfish...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00372_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oooh, that's some pent-up frustration~.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00374_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "And today, they could not coordinate well because of a petty argument...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00375_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Did you tell them you want them to make up?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00376_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I did. I had the three that started the argument apologize.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00378_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "According to my calculations, that should have resulted in them making up...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00379_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Why, that's...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00380_IrOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "How do I put it...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00381_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Very roundabout. That's Vri for you~.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00382_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yotsuha, that's rude!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00383_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "But trying to get them to make up, all calculating like that, wouldn't work, would iiiit?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00384_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "You deny my talent? Then how am I supposed to do this?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00385_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Thanks for coming, everyone!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00386_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh yeah~. She is Legend is playing today.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00387_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Maybe we should just listen all quiet for once without getting all excited~.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00388_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "...Agreed. That matches my current mood.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00389_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Listen to what we've got! \"The Epicurean Technique\"!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00390_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(Aah, their new song makes warmth bubble up form within... It is just like kari.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00391_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Kayamori and her band are really something. Their concert sent my sleepiness away~",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00392_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "The elation this performance induces in people... It cannot be explained with logic.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00393_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It's just like Kayamori's songs. You can try to logic your way through interpersonal relations, but nothing's going to go smoother than expressing your feelingsss.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00394_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "That's right! Like, look at our family. We sit around the dinner table every day to express our feelings to each other.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00395_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Sometimes we bicker, yes, but that's how we nurture our bonds.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00396_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Dining together... Bonds... Logic...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00397_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Vritika Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00397_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "You are amazing, Mother. When they eat your kari, Father and my siblings always smile and get along.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00398_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Vritika Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00398_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "What kind of formula did you use?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00399_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00399_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Hehe, my kari is magical.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00400_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00400_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Maganir... Your father, and Vijay, Sharmila, and Deepak all get along under its spell.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00401_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Vritika Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00401_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "But is magic not a fictional supernatural phenomenon that ignores the laws of physics? Magic does not exist, Mother.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00402_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00402_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Hmm... You're so brilliant it puts a damper on your dreams, my daughter...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00403_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00403_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Yes, calling it magic would be an exaggeration, but this kari <i>is</i> special. And that's why it helps everyone get along.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00404_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Vritika Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00404_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Really? Could you give me its recipe?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00405_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00405_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "The recipe is...well, a secret, I'm afraid. You have to make lots of kari to find it.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00406_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00406_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Find it with your brilliant maths.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00407_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Vri?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00408_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "...In truth, I do not know how it works, but I do know a way of tightening bonds between people.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00409_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It relates to a story from my family.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00410_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Much like 31-X right now, my family did not always get along.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00411_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "My father was busy with work, and my older siblings were always occupied with work and studies. They often disagreed and bickered... And I, the youngest child, could only watch.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00412_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "When this happened, my mother would make us special kari.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00413_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "And when everyone ate this kari, oddly enough, they all laughed together and resolved their disputes.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00414_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "In honor of its great efficacy, I decided to call it this:",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00415_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "The ultimate kari.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00416_NiOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Ultimate...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00417_MiOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Kari?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00418_IrOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "That's a pretty dumb name...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00419_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "...I guarantee you I am quite serious.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00420_MuOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "So you think eating it will deepen 31-X's bonds?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00421_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "That should work, yes. But unfortunately, I have not yet recreated the recipe...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00422_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Hold on~. Is it different from the recipe you taught me?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC05_00597_VBalakrishnan_ref",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Namaste... I just finished passing on my personal kari recipe to Yotsuha.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00424_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It was a trial recipe, the one that came closest to the ultimate kari.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00425_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "But it should have tasted better... I may have gotten the spice distribution wrong.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00426_MuOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Your mother didn't teach you the recipe?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00427_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I asked her many times, but she always told me to find it on my own.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00428_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I have tried many times to recreate the recipe, but I could never achieve that flavor... I have always wanted to someday reach it, however.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00429_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Since my calculations cannot apply here, this seems to be the only way.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00430_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Mmgh...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00431_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "What is the matter?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00432_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Nothing... Yes, I hope you manage to make the ultimate kari.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00433_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Dhanyavaad, Ichiko.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00434_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I think just getting all those complaints out like you did earlier should make you feel better, though~.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00435_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "As obstinate as they may be, they are kind, caring teammates. They understand the importance of coordination. They probably hate being told about it over and over when they already know.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00436_IrOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "For all your complaints, you do seem to care about them a lot.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00437_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "...Yes. Just as you care for your sisters, I hold 31-X dear to my heart.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00438_IcOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Heheh, if they make you feel that way, I'm sure 31-X's bonds will be firm.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00439_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I... Yes. I hope so.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00440_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I appreciate you listening to my story. Tomorrow, I will try to tackle the question of the ultimate kari.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00441_YoOhshima",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yeaaah? Maybe you should ask Maruyama and the squad for help~.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00442_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "We have a mission tomorrow, so their help would be very appreciated.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00443_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Dhanyavaad, everyone. It was an honor to spend this time with you.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00444_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(I will tighten 31-X's bonds... This time, I will do it.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    }
  ],
